   "cooked": "<p>A piece of bare earth can’t be too crazy, the Perchy (artist) has so far produced 5 of them.<br/>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24.jpeg\" title=\"Bankless Nation\"><img alt=\"Bankless Nation\" data-base62-sha1=\"gTyBLbqjgsNdjFsLHb0tw3XFv4E\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24_2_10x10.png\" height=\"492\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24_2_690x492.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24_2_690x492.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24_2_1035x738.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/766a8b08827d499d5127d252c7c8002544a93b24_2_1380x984.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Bankless Nation</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1371 394 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/de66426ad5e09901461b4f9c60415e2597f89544\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/de66426ad5e09901461b4f9c60415e2597f89544.webp\" title=\"metaMountain\"><img alt=\"metaMountain\" data-base62-sha1=\"vJr5tmPLRcT9Tpj4AedIqvPVoZm\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/de66426ad5e09901461b4f9c60415e