se href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">NFT</span><span class=\"informations\">667×1000 174 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br/>\n<img alt=\"CastleEthereum\" data-base62-sha1=\"b4E8dnprZvUg6zbtjrcUxvWHCTH\" height=\"453\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/4d9e660622ddefcd08cd42ac15c33c13457c49bd.jpeg\" width=\"680\"/>\n<p>so we want some pavement to put ??? statues ??? to Hall of Famers plus lotsa rabbit holes for TEAcademy. The rest we can commission building blocks that move around as private monuments (just pass the hat around). Or cut/paste existing noted TEC graduates … can you identify any?</p>",
